==French==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro|fr}} ''[[manage#Old French|manage]]'', {{term|mainage|lang=fro}}, from {{term|manoir|lang=fro}}, {{term|maneir|lang=fro}}, {{term|maindre|lang=fro}}, from {{etyl|la|fr}} {{term|manēre|lang=la}}. The Old French forms {{term|maisnage|lang=fro}}, {{term|mesnage|lang=fro}} were influenced by the word {{term|maisnée|lang=fro}}, {{term|maisnede|lang=fro}}, from Vulgar Latin *''mansionata'', from Latin {{term|mansiō|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Fr-ménage.ogg|audio|lang=fr}}
* {{IPA|/menaʒ/|lang=fr}}

===Noun===
{{fr-noun|m}}

# [[housework]], [[housekeeping]]
# [[household]]

